OL,3,GNEWSAWomen face 'hidden curfew' for
OL,4,Aexercise as evenings darken
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe clocks have gone back and, for many
OL,7,Fwomen, the freedom to exercise outdoors
OL,8,Fhas gone with them as darker evenings
OL,9,Fbring a "hidden curfew", according to
OL,10,Fthe This Girl Can campaign.
OL,12,FThe campaign's new nationwide movement,
OL,13,FLet's Lift the Curfew, says its
OL,14,Fresearch suggests more than half of
OL,15,Fwomen in the South West, 58%, feel
OL,16,Funsafe exercising alone after dark.
OL,18,FHead of campaigns, Kate Peers, said:
OL,19,F"We want to raise awareness of how
OL,20,Fsafety concerns can stop women being
OL,21,Factive outdoors once the clocks go
OL,22,Fback."
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
